{
  "name": "CRYPTO 06 — NFT Mint Watcher (Eligibility + Alert)",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "field": "minutes",
              "minutesInterval": 15
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "sched",
      "name": "Watch Every 15 Minute",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        240,
        300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "n1",
              "name": "kontrak",
              "value": "REPLACE_WALLET_TWIST",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "n2",
              "name": "wallet",
              "value": "REPLACE_WALLET_BURNER",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "n3",
              "name": "rpc",
              "value": "https://bsc.publicnode.com/",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "n4",
              "name": "nama_koleksi",
              "value": "Proof of Agent (Ptah)",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "cfg",
      "name": "NFT Target",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        460,
        300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "={{ $json.rpc }}",
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={\n  \"jsonrpc\": \"2.0\",\n  \"id\": 1,\n  \"method\": \"eth_call\",\n  \"params\": [\n    { \"to\": \"{{ $json.kontrak }}\", \"data\": \"REPLACE_NFT_CONTRACT00000000000000000000000000000000\" },\n    \"latest\"\n  ]\n}",
        "options": {
          "timeout": 15000
        }
      },
      "id": "rpc",
      "name": "Check ownerOf tokenId 0",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        680,
        300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const wallet = $('NFT Target').item.json.wallet.toLowerCase();\nconst result = $json.result || '0x';\nconst owner = '0x' + result.slice(26).toLowerCase();\nconst owns = owner === wallet;\n\nlet message = '';\nif (owns) {\n  message = 'ALREADY OWNS THE NFT\\n\\n';\n  message += 'Collection: ' + $('NFT Target').item.json.nama_koleksi + '\\n';\n  message += 'Wallet: ' + wallet.slice(0,10) + '...' + wallet.slice(-6) + '\\n\\n';\n  message += 'No need to mint right now.';\n}\n\nreturn [{ json: { owns, owner, wallet, message } }];\n"
      },
      "id": "check",
      "name": "Check Ownership",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        900,
        300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "loose"
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "c1",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.punya }}",
              "rightValue": "true",
              "operator": {
                "type": "boolean",
                "operation": "true"
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "if",
      "name": "Already Owns?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        1120,
        300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "sendMessage",
        "chatId": "REPLACE_CHAT_ID",
        "text": "={{ $json.message }}",
        "additionalFields": {
          "parse_mode": "Markdown"
        }
      },
      "id": "send",
      "name": "Notify Already Owns",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.telegram",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        1340,
        220
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "telegramApi": {
          "id": "REPLACE_CREDENTIAL_ID",
          "name": "Telegram Bot"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## CRYPTO 06 — NFT Mint Watcher\n\nPurpose: watch whether your wallet already owns an NFT from the target collection.\n\nWhat to edit:\n- kontrak: the NFT contract address\n- wallet: your wallet\n- rpc: the chain RPC\n- nama_koleksi: the name used in notifications\n\nImportant note: this node is read-only. Automatic minting requires a private key — NEVER put a private key in n8n if other people can access your instance.\n\nSafe approach: the watcher tells you when you do not own it yet, you mint manually from MetaMask, and the watcher tells you once you own it.\n\nUpgrade: add a totalSupply vs maxSupply check to see the remaining quota.",
        "height": 380,
        "width": 600,
        "color": 5
      },
      "id": "note",
      "name": "Panduan",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        160,
        100
      ]
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "Watch Every 15 Minute": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "NFT Target",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "NFT Target": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Check ownerOf tokenId 0",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Check ownerOf tokenId 0": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Check Ownership",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Check Ownership": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Already Owns?",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Already Owns?": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Notify Already Owns",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ],
        []
      ]
    }
  },
  "settings": {
    "executionOrder": "v1"
  },
  "staticData": null,
  "pinData": {}
}